cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MISMOTur: QR-code “museum passport” for a network of ethnographic museums (MIT App Inventor (Android), 2020)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "MISMOTur turns a visit to a network of five small ethnographic museums in a border mountain area into a game. Each museum has its own screen with a description; at each museum the visitor scans the QR code on site and the app stamps the visit. When all museums have been visited the app congratulates the visitor and prepares an e-mail to claim a prize. Interface in Slovene, Italian and English."
authors:
